  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Avrop av upphandlingsst&#xf6;d</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Call-off procurement support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen avser avropa upphandlingstj&#xe4;nster till st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r ambassaden att genomf&#xf6;ra tre upphandlingar av tekniskt st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra f&#xf6;ljande utvecklingsinsatser:

- 55020195 f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrat policyframtagande, st&#xf6;d till Office of Prime Minister
- 55020175, Agency for Gender Equality 
- 53030066 Kosovo Environmental Programme 

Alla tre insatser genomf&#xf6;rs inom offentliga sektorn, beslutades under 2015, och ska genomf&#xf6;ras 2016-2019. P&#xe5; grund av h&#xf6;g korruptionsrisk samt bristande upphandlingsregelverk- och upphandlingskapacitet ska ambassaden vara upphandlande part.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is a call-off of procurement services that will support the Embassy to conduct three procurements of technical assistance for the following interventions: 

- 55020195 improved policy development, support to Office of Prime Minister
- 55020175, Agency for Gender Equality 
- 53030066 Kosovo Environmental Programme 

All three interventions are implemented within the public sector, were decided on during 2015 and have an activity period of 2016-2019. Due to high risk of corruption and weak procurement policies- and capacity the Embassy will be the procuring party.</narrative>
  </description>
